package pages

import "nearbyassist/views/layout"

templ TermsAndConditions() {
	@layout.BasicLayout() {
		<div class="prose max-w-3xl mx-auto p-6 bg-white shadow-lg rounded-lg">
			<h1 class="text-sm font-bold text-neutral-dark mb-4">NearbyAssist Terms and Conditions</h1>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">Welcome to NearbyAssist! We’re so glad you’re here. NearbyAssist is the platform that connects clients like you with service vendors (also called Service Providers) who can help you get things done. Before you start using the platform, we need to make sure you're aware of a few important things. By using our services, you agree to these Terms and Conditions. So, take a moment to read them through!</p>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">Definitions</h2>
			<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-gray mt-4">Service Vendor</h3>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">This is an individual that has an account on NearbyAssist that will offer services to you, the client. They could be anyone from a plumber to an electrician or a personal house cleaner. For this document, a “business” refers to a type of registered entity, namely sole proprietorships.</p>
			<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-gray mt-4">Client</h3>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">This refers to you – the person or business looking to hire someone for a specific task or service. You can use NearbyAssist to find Service Partners that meet your needs.</p>
			<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-gray mt-4">Users</h3>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">This is everyone on NearbyAssist, including both Service Vendors and Clients. You’re all part of our community!</p>
			<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-gray mt-4">Platform</h3>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">The NearbyAssist mobile app that connects you (the client) with Service Vendors, so you can get tasks done and Service Vendors can find new opportunities.</p>
			<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-gray mt-4">Job Request</h3>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">When you need something done, you can message any available service vendors directly on NearbyAssist and negotiate.</p>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">General Use of and Access to NearbyAssist</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">Welcome to NearbyAssist! We’re so excited to have you here. To get started, we’ve made it super easy for you to log in and access all the great services we offer. The quickest ways to log in is by using your Facebook account. This way, you won’t have to remember another password—just use your Facebook login, and you’re in!</p>
			<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-gray mt-4">When you log in with Facebook:</h3>
			<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-gray mb-4">
				<li class="text-xs">We’ll only pull in basic info like your name, email, and profile picture, so you can get started right away. Don’t worry, we won’t post anything on your Facebook timeline!</li>
				<li class="text-xs">Logging in with Facebook also makes it easy to connect with your friends and contacts on NearbyAssist, making it a more social experience.</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">By using NearbyAssist, you agree to follow our guidelines and rules (which we’ll keep updated), so everything stays smooth for everyone. And just a quick reminder, if you’re signing up as an individual, you’ll need to be at least 13 years old, and if you’re doing this on behalf of a business, make sure you’re authorized to do so.</p>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">Restricted Activities</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">At NearbyAssist, we want everyone to have a positive, safe experience. To make that happen, we ask that you not do any of the following:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-gray mb-4">
				<li class="text-xs"><strong>Don’t pretend to be someone else:</strong> This means no impersonating others or misrepresenting who you are or your connections. Be yourself!</li>
				<li class="text-xs"><strong>No illegal activities:</strong> Please don’t use NearbyAssist to offer or request services for anything illegal. We’re all here to help with the right tasks, the right way.</li>
				<li class="text-xs"><strong>Respect the Experience:</strong> We want everyone to enjoy using NearbyAssist, so please do not disrupt or interfere with the app’s functionality or security.</li>
				<li class="text-xs"><strong>Share Responsibly:</strong> Do not share any inappropriate or unlawful content within the app.</li>
				<li class="text-xs"><strong>Follow the rules:</strong> Always make sure you’re using NearbyAssist in line with the rules of the internet, connected networks, and the law.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-dark mt-6">Availability of NearbyAssist and Services</h2>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">We’re always working to improve NearbyAssist, which means we might need to upgrade, update, or make changes to the platform from time to time. While we do our best to keep everything running smoothly, there may be times when the platform or some services are temporarily unavailable or interrupted.</p>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">Unfortunately, we can’t guarantee 100% uptime, and we might need to suspend or even remove certain features or services without prior notice. If something changes and you're unable to access NearbyAssist, we apologize in advance, and we appreciate your understanding.</p>
			<p class="text-neutral-gray mb-4 text-xs">At NearbyAssist, we want to create a safe and positive environment for all users. Here’s how we handle monitoring and user conduct:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-gray mb-4">
				<li class="text-xs">We don’t actively monitor every single piece of content or activity, but we do reserve the right to investigate any suspicious behavior or violations of our guidelines.</li>
				<li class="text-xs">If we find something that doesn’t follow our rules, we may limit access or report the activity to authorities.</li>
				<li class="text-xs">If we suspect misleading or inaccurate information, we may act, including requesting clarification or restricting access.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	}
}
